{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras/df9db4103b8e1534a40f24024ea167b2.avif?t=1769593167\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras_big/df9db4103b8e1534a40f24024ea167b2.avif?t=1769593167 width=1560 height=870 /></span>Open your own tiny gem shop and take life at a softer pace. Wander through peaceful biomes, gather shimmering stones, and craft them into pieces that glow with care. Shape gems in your warm little workshop, design charming displays, and welcome curious customers. Upgrade your space, unlock new materials, and build a cozy sparkle empire one polished gem at a time.<br>Immerse yourself in a cozy, fantastical world of soft pastels and sparkling gems, where every corner glows with color and charm<br>Gemmy Gems uses a calm daily rhythm where you shape your own routine instead of racing against a clock. Each day unfolds in small steps;<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras/0ad03229d6f41a0bd4a5ffeb713dc229.avif?t=1769593167\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras_big/0ad03229d6f41a0bd4a5ffeb713dc229.webp?t=1769593167 width=1560 height=348 /></span>  <br>Wander through calm biomes and gather natural stones. Each area has its own colors, gem types, and tiny surprises. No rush, no pressure, just quiet exploring.<strong> </strong> <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras/465224e6cb2ba08a09e22c28c2b16695.avif?t=1769593167\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras_big/465224e6cb2ba08a09e22c28c2b16695.avif?t=1769593167 width=1560 height=454 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras/faa2dcb2634d9e6c450800da3f1fa58f.avif?t=1769593167\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras_big/faa2dcb2634d9e6c450800da3f1fa58f.webp?t=1769593167 width=1560 height=345 /></span>Wander peaceful biomes to uncover hidden stones and tiny sparkling gems tucked among plants. Each discovery is a small delight, with every gem holding the potential to become a beautiful treasure in your workshop. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras/bfa394728c3e659e8c81d54edcd92067.avif?t=1769593167\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras_big/bfa394728c3e659e8c81d54edcd92067.webp?t=1769593167 width=1560 height=368 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras/1d667af3df1012ef73bf46e2cc1905a4.avif?t=1769593167\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras_big/1d667af3df1012ef73bf46e2cc1905a4.webp?t=1769593167 width=1560 height=348 /></span>In your cozy workshop, shape, polish, and refine each gem with care. Every precise touch adds sparkle, while a slip leaves its mark your hands bring every treasure to life.   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras/1dea320034cd551c26be59d5e461d4a8.avif?t=1769593167\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras_big/1dea320034cd551c26be59d5e461d4a8.webp?t=1769593167 width=1560 height=423 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras/4b97cce38c11304c2e55977f0a610374.avif?t=1769593167\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras_big/4b97cce38c11304c2e55977f0a610374.webp?t=1769593167 width=1560 height=308 /></span>Shoppers drop by with different tastes. Some want sparkle, some want subtle beauty. Whether you sell your favorite piece or keep it for display is completely up to you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras/9eab65912c700835926e746fcd8ad73c.avif?t=1769593167\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/extras_big/9eab65912c700835926e746fcd8ad73c.webp?t=1769593167 width=1560 height=392 /></span><strong>\u201cWhether you\u2019re perfecting your craft or just enjoying the calm glow of your workshop, Gemmy Gems gives you a slow, cozy place to unwind and create at your own pace.&quot;</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103850?t=1769593167","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103850?t=1769593167","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/585b0ee01ab7b1141c821186dd04dccc938222a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769593167","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103850/585b0ee01ab7b1141c821186dd04dccc938222a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769593167","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared